    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "TRAVEL INFORMATION\nWORLD ROUTES\nU.S. A.\nORIENT\nEUROPE\nPHILIPPInE AIR LInES\nROUTE OF THE Orient Star\nSPANNING 3 OF THE WORLD",
      "OSLO-\n• HELSINKI\nSTOCKHOLM\nLONDON\n- MADRID\nDAKAR\nCOPENHAGEN\n* AMSTERDAM\n* PARIS\nGENEVA\nROME\nSASHERA\nTUNIS\nALGIERS\"\nTEL AVIV\n(LYDDA, • TEHRAN\n*ADEN\nADDIS ABABA\nMONROVIA\nHAIKUBI\nSHEMYA\n•KARACHI a\nNEW DELHI\nCALCUTTA\nHONG\nKONG\nBOMBAY\nCOLUMBU\nBANGKOK\nSINGAPORE\nANCHORAGE\nVANCOUVER\nSEATTLE\nPORTLANt\nSAN FRANCISCO\nLOs\nANGELES\nWINNIPEG\n- NEW\nORLEANS:\nTOKYO\nOKINAWA\n• TATPEH\nMANILA\nGUAM\nHONOLULU\nWAKE\nSUVA\n•CAPETOWN\nLEARMONTH\nPERTH\nNOUMEA\n*\nPHILIPPINE AIR LINES\nROUTE OF THE Orient Star\nP. A. L. PROPOSED ROUTES\nCONNECTING AIR LINES\nP.A. L. OFFICES\nBRISBANE\nSTUNE\nMONTREAL\nGANDER\nIEW YORK\n* WASHINGTON\nBERMUDA\nHAVANA\nVARALAS\nBELEM\nLIMA\nSANT AGU\nRIO DE JANEIRO\nAUCKLAND\nROUTE OF THE\nGeneral Offices:\nM. R. S. Building, Plaza Cervantes\nMANILA, Philippines\nOrient Star\nInteresting and useful information\nfor world travelers.\nFew travel experiences can equal the fascination and\ninterest of a trip along Philippine Air Lines' \"Route of\nthe Orient Star.\" Stopping at fourteen cities in eleven\ncountries, the traveler along this route is treated to an\nextravaganza of scenic beauty, history, architecture, racial\ncustoms and national cultures. Here, indeed, is a pano-\nrama of contrasts: The new world and the old, oriental\nand occidental, tropical and temperate climates, vast\noceans and towering mountains.\nWhether you travel for business or pleasure — or both\n— you will want to extract the full measure of interest\nand enjoyment from your trip. This booklet has been\nprepared to help you do this — to provide you with a\n\"thumbnail sketch\" of what awaits you along the \"Route\nof the Orient Star.\" Included are practical tips con-\ncerning attire, accommodations and local transportation\nfacilities. Also included are general maps of the areas\nyou will visit and interesting data about the major cities\nof the world.\nShould you desire further information to help you pre-\npare for your trip, your Travel Agent or any Philippine\nAir Lines Office will be pleased to furnish it. If you\nrequire assistance en route, remember that every P.A. L.\nrepresentative is trained and eager to serve you."
    ],
